    },
    "Adless is working quietly in the background." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless is working quietly in the background." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless funciona discretamente em segundo plano." } }
      }
    },
    "Adless keeps working even after you close the app." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless keeps working even after you close the app." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless continua funcionando mesmo depois que você fecha o app." } }
      }
    },
    "Adless may be offered through monthly and annual auto-renewable subscriptions. A subscription includes the features shown in the app at the time of purchase. Any free trial, price, renewal date, and applicable taxes are displayed by Apple before purchase.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account. Unless canceled through your Apple Account settings at least 24 hours before the end of the current period, a subscription renews automatically. Apple manages billing, refunds, and cancellation." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless may be offered through monthly and annual auto-renewable subscriptions. A subscription includes the features shown in the app at the time of purchase. Any free trial, price, renewal date, and applicable taxes are displayed by Apple before purchase.\n\nPayment is charged to your Apple Account. Unless canceled through your Apple Account settings at least 24 hours before the end of the current period, a subscription renews automatically. Apple manages billing, refunds, and cancellation." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless pode ser oferecido por meio de assinaturas mensais e anuais com renovação automática. A assinatura inclui os recursos exibidos no app no momento da compra. Qualquer período grátis, preço, data de renovação e impostos aplicáveis são mostrados pela Apple antes da compra.\n\nA cobrança é feita na sua Conta Apple. A menos que seja cancelada nos ajustes da sua Conta Apple pelo menos 24 horas antes do fim do período atual, a assinatura será renovada automaticamente. A Apple gerencia a cobrança, os reembolsos e o cancelamento." } }
      }
    },
    "Adless provides local DNS-based blocking of domains identified by its blocklist. No filtering system can identify every ad, tracker, or domain, and blocking a domain can occasionally affect a website or app. You are responsible for deciding whether to keep the protection enabled." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless provides local DNS-based blocking of domains identified by its blocklist. No filtering system can identify every ad, tracker, or domain, and blocking a domain can occasionally affect a website or app. You are responsible for deciding whether to keep the protection enabled." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless faz o bloqueio local, baseado em DNS, dos domínios identificados pela lista de bloqueio. Nenhum sistema de filtragem consegue identificar todos os anúncios, rastreadores ou domínios, e bloquear um domínio pode ocasionalmente afetar um site ou app. Cabe a você decidir se deseja manter a proteção ativada." } }
      }
    },
    "Adless uses Apple’s Network Extension DNS Proxy to process DNS queries on your device and block domains included in the active blocklist. Blocked names are answered locally. Permitted DNS queries are sent as encrypted DNS-over-HTTPS wire messages to Cloudflare DNS or Quad9 so they can be resolved. Adless does not operate a server or a remote VPN service." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless uses Apple’s Network Extension DNS Proxy to process DNS queries on your device and block domains included in the active blocklist. Blocked names are answered locally. Permitted DNS queries are sent as encrypted DNS-over-HTTPS wire messages to Cloudflare DNS or Quad9 so they can be resolved. Adless does not operate a server or a remote VPN service." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless usa o DNS Proxy da Network Extension da Apple para processar consultas DNS no seu dispositivo e bloquear domínios incluídos na lista ativa. Os nomes bloqueados recebem respostas locais. As consultas DNS permitidas são enviadas como mensagens DNS-over-HTTPS criptografadas para o Cloudflare DNS ou o Quad9 para serem resolvidas. O Adless não opera um servidor nem um serviço de VPN remoto." } }
      }
    },
    "Adless is developed by Orbe Works. This Privacy Policy explains what happens when you use the Adless iOS app and website." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless is developed by Orbe Works. This Privacy Policy explains what happens when you use the Adless iOS app and website." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless é desenvolvido pela Orbe Works. Esta Política de Privacidade explica o que acontece quando você usa o app iOS e o site do Adless." } }
      }
    },
    "Adless may update the blocklist, app, or service to improve reliability and security. The app keeps a valid local list and can continue using it when the network is unavailable, but uninterrupted operation cannot be guaranteed." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless may update the blocklist, app, or service to improve reliability and security. The app keeps a valid local list and can continue using it when the network is unavailable, but uninterrupted operation cannot be guaranteed." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless pode atualizar a lista de bloqueio, o app ou o serviço para melhorar a confiabilidade e a segurança. O app mantém uma lista local válida e pode continuar usando-a quando a rede estiver indisponível, mas não é possível garantir o funcionamento ininterrupto." } }
      }
    },
    "Adless does not maintain a user account or server-side user record. Local blocklists, subscription state, and blocking statistics can be removed by deleting the app. Apple manages purchase records and subscription history." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Adless does not maintain a user account or server-side user record. Local blocklists, subscription state, and blocking statistics can be removed by deleting the app. Apple manages purchase records and subscription history." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "O Adless não mantém uma conta de usuário nem um registro no servidor. As listas de bloqueio locais, o estado da assinatura e as estatísticas de bloqueio podem ser removidos ao apagar o app. A Apple gerencia os registros de compra e o histórico de assinaturas." } }
      }
    },
    "Any free trial, price, renewal date, and applicable taxes are displayed by Apple before purchase." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Any free trial, price, renewal date, and applicable taxes are displayed by Apple before purchase." } },
        "pt-BR" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Qualquer período grátis, preço, data de renovação e impostos aplicáveis são mostrados pela Apple antes da compra." } }
      }
    },
